FAVICON.ICO PLACEHOLDER

This file should be replaced with an actual .ico file containing:
- 16x16px icon
- 32x32px icon
- 48x48px icon

Design specification for Norse mythology favicon:
- Symbol: Mjölnir (Thor's hammer) or Valknut (three interlocked triangles)
- Colors: Gold (#D4AF37) on dark background (#1a1a2e) or transparent
- Style: Simple, bold lines that work at small sizes
- Format: ICO with multiple resolutions embedded

Tools to create:
- Online: https://favicon.io/ or https://realfavicongenerator.net/
- Design in Figma/Sketch and export as ICO
- Use ImageMagick: convert icon.png -define icon:auto-resize=48,32,16 favicon.ico
